  id: lion
  displayName: Lion
  habitat: Grassy plains and open savanna. See them in the Maasai Mara.
  status: Vulnerable (IUCN Red List)
  fact: Kenya Wildlife Service figures show Kenya's lions rose from 2,000 in 2010
    to 2,589 in 2021. Community-led conservancies return tourism revenue to local
    people and give lions a safe haven.
  viewingTip: On a game drive you stay inside the vehicle. A lion often ignores a
    car, but it treats a person on foot very differently, so never walk up to one.
  warningLine: The lion is growling. Back away slowly, never run.
  viewingRadius: 15
  dangerRadius: 6
